WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:01,430
general red hawk

2
00:00:01,810 --> 00:00:03,210
This eighth grade

3
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:05,130
Our Daying newly enters the eighth level

4
00:00:05,290 --> 00:00:06,290
About to see the Queen

5
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:10,920
I'll go in and meet the Queen

6
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:12,120
You wait outside first

7
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:16,480
Are you guys on errands?

8
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:19,680
Yes. What do you call Shi He Tang?

9
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:21,560
A small soldier in the red eagle.

10
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:24,600
Don't you think you are a soldier?

11
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:26,000
It definitely doesn't look like it

12
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:27,320
You are the eighth grade

13
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:30,020
The queen's palace is so luxurious

14
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:32,180
There must be a lot of treasures in it, right?

15
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:33,460
Of course

16
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:38,940
Let’s talk about Xing Hongying in detail

17
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:40,660
why are you back

18
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:43,930
Didn’t I ask you to find an opportunity to attack the Dou Sheng Fake Chong Eagle?

19
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:47,680
The fake Chong Eagle has been wiped out.

20
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:51,590
What should I say to you if I say total annihilation?

21
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:54,100
Except for a few low-grade pottery stews

22
00:00:54,420 --> 00:01:00,190
If Chong Daying is already dead and injured, tell me.

23
00:01:00,750 --> 00:01:04,110
How do you destroy the fake Chongdaying? It's very simple.

24
00:01:04,550 --> 00:01:05,990
Just one tanglang will do it
